# `astro.config` (web)

- **File:** `apps/web/astro.config.mjs` defines: `@tailwindcss/vite` in `vite.plugins`, `@astrojs/sitemap` in `integrations`, `site`, `markdown` / `shikiConfig`, and `experimental.svgo`.
- **Do not document integrations** (e.g. MDX, React, partytown) unless they appear in this file and in `apps/web/package.json`.
- **Changing `site`:** updates sitemap/canonical base; align with production domain. Default SEO may also use Sanity `siteSettings.siteUrl` in `Seo.astro` when configured.
